{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/extras/cards_header.gif?t=1749157395\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The beautiful city of Rio de Janeiro! And we have many cats to find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy and wholesome experience in the most recognizable city in Brazil!</strong> Start with a Beautiful monochromatic scenario, relax, and find all the cats to reveal the final colored art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 920 hidden objects to find!!! </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find the cats and paint the city.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Look for special cats and unlock bonus levels.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover Rio's Landmarks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect many cards and earn achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the radar to help search for cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic Sound FX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exclusive Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/extras/bonus-levels.gif?t=1749157395\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Main Level - Rio de Janeiro</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 cats to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 Special Cats that unlock bonus levels and give hints. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 20 city people to help you earn radar hints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bonus Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Levels with different sizes and numbers of kittens to find.  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bar: </strong>50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cable Car:</strong> 50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Grocery Store:</strong> 50 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Community:</strong> 75 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Maracan\u00e3:</strong> 100 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Botanical Garden</strong>: 100 kittens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Carnival:</strong> 100 kittens + 50 people</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Accessibility</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dark Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invert Mouse Zoom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse Drag Sensitivity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Edge Screen Scrolling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Color Blindness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2780690?t=1749157395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/968d6ef62e4f22a693368c9481698f1ecb328f15/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749157395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/fb9f40cafd829a82af19eeb28c97dca4e9cccc3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749157395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/fb9f40cafd829a82af19eeb28c97dca4e9cccc3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749157395","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://